&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;src/components/ui/theme-menu.tsx&lt;/code&gt; — a &lt;strong&gt;minimal generic stand-in&lt;/strong&gt; for the button and menu primitives. Swap it for your own UI kit; only the exported names matter to the changer:&lt;br&gt;
