&lt;p&gt;Resize no longer touches layout properties. A container query owns the card's typography. During drag, only a transform scales a preview ghost. &lt;code&gt;pointerup&lt;/code&gt; commits a data attribute the exporter reads. Animating &lt;code&gt;transform&lt;/code&gt; stays on the compositor; width and height writes do not. If &lt;code&gt;pointerup&lt;/code&gt; never fires, the attribute stays at the last commit and the ghost is discarded on the next frame.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

